OL,3,GNEWSAPride of Place is 'once in a
OL,4,Ageneration opportunity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn September 2025, the government
OL,7,Fawarded Peterborough #40m through its
OL,8,FPride in Place programme to help
OL,9,Fregenerate two of the city's most
OL,10,Fdeprived areas.
OL,12,FUnder the scheme, the combined
OL,13,Fneighbourhoods of Paston, Gunthorpe and
OL,14,FWelland - and Orton Malborne and Orton
OL,15,FGoldhay - will both receive up to #2m a
OL,16,Fyear over the next decade.
OL,18,FWhat could the cash mean for the
OL,19,Fcommunities it will transform?
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
