OL,3,GNEWSAPride of Place is 'once in a
OL,4,Ageneration opportunity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is investing in 169
OL,7,Fareas across England, each receiving up
OL,8,Fto #2m a year for 10 years. A further
OL,9,F95 places will receive a one-off
OL,10,Fpayment of #1.5m.
